# ── Web3 & Network Configuration ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# PASTE YOUR OWN PROVIDER LINK HERE (Alchemy / Infura / QuickNode / public node)
# to switch the engine out of pure simulator mode — OR use the dashboard's
# RPC plug-in (🔑 API Keys → RPC Provider Plug-in), which stores the link in the
# orchestrator's memory; the engine pulls it from /api/rpc-config on its next
# start, so editing this file is optional:
#
#   RPC_HTTP_URL=https://eth-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY
#   RPC_WEBSOCKET_URL=wss://eth-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY
#
# When a link is configured, the engine validates the endpoint at startup
# (eth_chainId + eth_blockNumber) and logs its mode as LIVE RPC. Market data
# (prices/liquidity) still comes from the simulator until the Phase 4 live
# pipeline lands — validation confirms your link/policy works in the meantime.
# Primary network for the dashboard (sepolia | unichain-sepolia | mainnet)
# Unichain Sepolia: testnet playground with mock USDT/USDC pools
NETWORK_NAME=sepolia
RPC_WEBSOCKET_URL=
RPC_HTTP_URL=
# NOT USED: TRusT-AI is non-custodial and never signs with a private key.
PRIVATE_KEY=

# ── DEX & Execution Parameters ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Uniswap v4 Universal Router — the only swap route (the legacy v3 path was
# removed 2026-09-15). Resolved automatically from NETWORK_NAME by
# apps/server/src/uniswapApi.ts; UNISWAP_V4_ROUTER overrides it for custom
# networks. Known networks (see docs/design/uniswap-routing-v3-v4-hooks.md and
# the official Uniswap v4 deployments table:
# https://developers.uniswap.org/docs/protocols/v4/deployments):
#   - unichain-sepolia:     0xf70536b3bcc1bd1a972dc186a2cf84cc6da6be5d
#     (Uniswap Universal Router on Unichain Sepolia, chain ID 1301)
#   - unichain:             0xef740bf23acae26f6492b10de645d6b98dc8eaf3
#     (Uniswap Universal Router on mainnet Unichain, chain ID 130)
#   - ethereum:             0x4c82d1fbfe28c977cbb58d8c7ff8fcf9f70a2cca
#     (Universal Router 2.1.1 on Ethereum mainnet)
# NOTE: NETWORK_NAME also drives the route/summary label in the dashboard
# (e.g. ``UNICHAIN-SEPOLIA``).
# UNISWAP_V4_ROUTER=
# Initial max slippage accepted by the orchestrator (used until the dashboard overwrites it).
DEFAULT_SLIPPAGE_BPS=50
# Default per-signal trade budget in ETH (server-side cap for AI decisions).
# The dashboard lets the user override it (> 0, below the wallet balance); the
# value is kept in localStorage and mirrored here at runtime via /api/settings.
MAX_TRADE_AMOUNT_ETH=0.25

# ── AI Provider Settings ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Options: mock | openai | anthropic | deepseek | gemini | ollama_cloud | ollama
# ollama_cloud targets https://ollama.com with an API key (no local install);
# OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL overrides its model (default gemma4:31b). Local ollama
# stays keyless (OLLAMA_BASE_URL / OLLAMA_MODEL).
# Bring-your-own-model: the key typed in the dashboard (browser localStorage)
# takes precedence over AI_API_KEY below; nothing is ever stored server-side.
# The code reads LLM_PROVIDER (NOT AI_PROVIDER). Keep this name.
LLM_PROVIDER=mock
AI_API_KEY=
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=deepseek-r1:latest

# ── System Ports ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SERVER_HOST=127.0.0.1
ENGINE_PORT=50051           # Reserved (unused; no gRPC server yet)
SERVER_PORT=3001            # Express + WebSocket gateway
SERVER_BIND=0.0.0.0         # Host the orchestrator binds to (LAN dev default).
                            # The desktop shell (apps/desktop, Tauri) spawns the
                            # server with SERVER_BIND=127.0.0.1 so the packaged
                            # app is only reachable from the user's machine.
WEB_PORT=5173               # Vite server (hardcoded in apps/web/vite.config.ts)
